/E (For this task, I established a professional digital presence by creating andupdating accounts on GitHub, LinkedIn, and Kaggle. These platforms serve as the foundationfor my professional identity in the academic and tech communities. I use GitHub tohost my code and collaborate on projects,and I have initialized my profile README withmy name, branch, and learning goals. LinkedIn acts as my primary professional networking tool, where I have detailed my current degree and education at VIT Bhopal. Kaggle provides a specialized space for me to practice data science and engage with global datasets.  Over the next four years, I plan to use these tools strategically. I will use GitHub to maintain a transparent history of my technical growth by documenting all my college projects. LinkedIn will be essential for connecting with industry professionals and alumni for internship opportunities. Finally, I will use Kaggle to sharpen my analytical skills through competitions. Together, these platforms ensure I am prepared for the expectations of future employers.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
