/E (In the professional world, a single poorly drafted email can lead to significant consequences, as seen in a hypothetical scenario where a student requests an assignment extension. In this case, the student sent a last-minute, informal message with no subject line, failing to include their registration number or a valid reason for the delay. The professor, overwhelmed by emails, ignored the message due to its unprofessional tone and lack of clarity, resulting in the student missing the deadline and failing the module.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
