/E (By developing interactive awareness tools like the Google Forms quiz and the Digital Safety Infographic, the project moved beyond theory to provide tangible value to the community. The core takeaway is that digital literacy is not a static skill but a continuous practice of skepticism, data minimization, and proactive security. As I move forward, the professional accounts and the prevention guides created here will serve as a foundation for a secure, impactful digital presence. This project confirms that while technology will always evolve, a well- informed and cautious user remains the most effective defense against the complexities of identity-based fraud in the digital age.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
